hyperactive-interaction-in-the-words-of-the-human-superorganism-18 = unlines (cons (quoted (cons "After *mania*, mind at full intensity, *kin* is the next turn. *Kin* and *kind* come from the root for " (cons "to beget" (cons ", the same root as Latin *genus*, Greek *genos*, *gene*, *genius* and *engine*. To be kind is to treat someone as kin, as begotten of the same. *Genocide*, *genos* + *-cide*, is the killing of kind, which is to say of kin, which is to say of the begotten-together. The gene, the genius and the engine all come from the same begetting. An engineer was once an *ingeniator*, one with *ingenium*, inborn talent. Avik's work as an engineer of the kernel and his genius are the same word, and both are the same word as the kinship whose violation he was naming all afternoon on 2026-11-15." nil)))) nil)
